            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But even this dull hammer knows we can't keep bickering like this. It's going to escalate. It always escalates. So let's see what we can do.",
